<title>UK: Norddeutsche announces 1997 copper premiums.</title>
<headline>Norddeutsche announces 1997 copper premiums.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>German metal refiner Norddeutsche Affinerie (NA) said on Wednesday that its official 1997 premium applying to sales of all NA copper products will be $27 a tonne for average pricing.</p>
<p>The premium for unknown pricing will be $40 a tonne, in both cases based on the copper grade A settlement price on the London Metal Exchange (LME), NA said in a release.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8080</p>
</text>
